<title>USA: W.R. Grace completes buyback at $73.69 shr.</title>
<headline>W.R. Grace completes buyback at $73.69 shr.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>W. R. Grace &amp; Co said Monday it has completed the repurchase of about 10 million shares of its outstanding common stock at an average price of $73.69 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>Under a second buyback announced in February, the company will buy up to 20 percent of the roughly 89 million outstanding shares of a spinoff to Grace common shareholders later this month.</p>
</text>
